      "text": "[2:25PM] #Ogolonto #IkoroduRoad #TrafficUpdate \n\nA 6 tyres LT van  loaded with plywood has had one of its tyres detach while in operation at Okeriya, inward ikorodu Garage. A tow vehicle operator has been contacted for evacuation. Meanwhile, our officers are on ground, ensuring the continued flow of traffic on the corridor. \n\n#FollowLASTMA",
